        (`sch 6 Part 1 row 7 the consideration for the issue or intended issue of those shares and debentures`)
        (`sch 6 Part 1 row 8 the number, description and amount of the shares or debentures under option`)
        (`sch 6 Part 1 row 9 the period during which the option is exercisable`)
        (`sch 6 Part 1 row 10 the price to be paid for shares or debentures subscribed for or acquired under option`)
        (`sch 6 Part 1 row 11 the consideration for the option or right to option`)
        (`sch 6 Part 1 row 12 the persons to whom the option or right to option was given`)
        (`sch 6 Part 1 row 13 the names and addresses of the vendors of property purchased or acquired, or proposed to be`)
        (`sch 6 Part 1 row 14 the amount payable to each separate vendor`)
        (`sch 6 Part 1 row 15 the amount paid or payable for any such property, specifying the amount for goodwill`)
        (`sch 6 Part 1 row 16 short particulars of any transaction relating to such property completed within the 2 preceding years in which a vendor, promoter, director or proposed director had an interest`)
        (`sch 6 Part 1 row 17 the amount paid or payable as commission for subscribing or procuring subscriptions, or the rate of the commission`)
